# 기술 스택 미정 — 언어·프레임워크별 항목은 스택 확정 후 추가한다.
# 지금은 OS·에디터가 만드는 파일만 제외한다.

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Windows ---
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# --- Linux ---
.directory
.Trash-*
.fuse_hidden*
.nfs*

# --- JetBrains ---
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
out/

# --- VS Code ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace
.history/

# --- Vim / Emacs ---
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.*.sw[a-p]
Session.vim
\#*\#
.\#*
tags

# --- Sublime ---
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# --- 기타 ---
*.log
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
